            "helpMarkdown": "# Read by topic\n\nCenter Example - Read by topic. Compare navigation, filtering and workspace guides.\n\n## Note data\n\n```yaml\ntags:\n- kplex/navigation\n```\n\nThe recognized tags are #kplex/navigation, #kplex/filtering and #kplex/workspace. YAML tags may omit the leading #; this preset matches their displayed tag form. Sidecar has two matching tags and stays Conflicting. Tags classify notes here; category drops do not edit them. Replace these with topics you actually use.",
