            "helpMarkdown": "# Learning route\n\nCenter Example - Choose a learning route. Understand a concept, try an action, then apply it.\n\n## Note data\n\n```yaml\nNote type: Concept\n```\n\nConcept, Guide and Use case are exact type values; category labels are friendly descriptions. This uses the configured Note type source, not the help tags. Category drops do not rewrite types. Choose your own existing types when adapting it.",
