            "helpMarkdown": "# Workbench questions\n\nCenter Example - Workbench questions. Choose reading or practice that fits a short or longer session.\n\n## Note data\n\n```yaml\nlearningMode: read\nsessionSize: short\n```\n\nEach category rule combines these two exact property facts. Example: `note.learningMode == \"read\" and note.sessionSize == \"short\"`. The condition editor and Code share the same rules. No duration is measured and no prose is analyzed. Change both the rules and this explanation when adapting it.",
            "helpSourceLocale": "en"
